[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[supica storage="D_sifuku_M CD_11_M"]
[playcv storage="supica_supica_00390_004.ogg" name="supica"]
[character name="supica"]
[FACEVIEW storage="supica_CD_11_FACE_sifuku"]
【真珠星】[r]「真珠星才不是小鸡……是龙一的女朋友」
